                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "qGaRv",
                  "x": 16,
                  "y": 16,
                  "name": "Motion Spec Heading",
                  "fill": "$theme-v2/fg",
                  "content": "02  下一时刻",
                  "fontFamily": "$theme-v2/font-primary",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "650"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "WaNhc",
                  "x": 16,
                  "y": 50,
                  "name": "Motion Spec Body",
                  "fill": "$theme-v2/muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 400,
                  "content": "共同时间点共享倒计时。展开后使用纵向鱼骨：同一时刻只共享时间节点，但每个日程和 Todo 都生成独立分支并直接展示，不再收敛成“2 个代办”等数量。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$theme-v2/font-primary",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "450"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "MnV6g",
              "x": 952,
              "y": 92,
              "name": "Motion Spec / 03  Reka 队列",
              "width": 434,
              "height": 170,
              "fill": "$theme-v2/surface",
              "cornerRadius": 14,
              "stroke": "$theme-v2/border",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "none",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fZBFN",
                  "x": 16,
                  "y": 16,
                  "name": "Motion Spec Heading",
                  "fill": "$theme-v2/fg",
                  "content": "03  Reka 队列",
                  "fontFamily": "$theme-v2/font-primary",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "650"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "BzVAt",
                  "x": 16,
                  "y": 50,
                  "name": "Motion Spec Body",
                  "fill": "$theme-v2/muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 400,
                  "content": "固定 188px 队列窗口；渲染前过滤全部 Goal 派生候选并重新计算数量。无内容时使用普通非 Goal 空态；有内容时在窗口内纵向滚动，查看全部进入完整有效队列。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$theme-v2/font-primary",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "450"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
